The KTH7823 product employs the SPI interface, operating in
CPOL = 1 and CPHA = 1 mode, to facilitate communication between microcontrollers and peripheral devices. Conforming to
the SPI international standard, the interface incorporates four
lines: SCK, MOSI, MISO, and CSN. Data transmission occurs
through fixed-length 16-bit packets.


